            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        2 Bakam 23:36—24:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.5+2CH.36.6+2CH.36.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byok 36:5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu businge bwa Yehoyakimu mutabani wa Yosiya omukama wa Yuda, MUKAMA akaragira Yeremiya ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Genda omb'Abarrekabbu obaze na bo, kandi obaleete omunju ya MUKAMA, obataahye omu kimu ha bisiika; hanyuma obahe eviini banywe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanyowe, nukwo kutwara Yaazaniya mutabani wa Yeremiya mwijukuru wa Habaziniya abanyina, batabanibe, n'enju yoona ey'Abarrekabbu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nabaleeta omunju ya MUKAMA, nabataahya omu kisiika eky'abatabani ba Hanani mutabani wa Igidaliya omuntu wa Ruhanga, ekikaba kiherraine n'ekisiika ky'abanyoro, eruguru y'ekisiika kya Maaseya mutabani wa Saluumu, omulinzi w'omulyango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma nabaleetera ensoha eziijwiire eviini, hamu n'ebikopo; nabagambira nti, “Eviini ngigyo munywe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangarukamu bati “Itwe titurukwija kunywa viini, habwokuba Yonadabbu isenkuru itwe mutabani wa Rrekabbu, akatuteererra ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Ebiro byona inywe, inywe na batabani banyu; mutalinywa eviini, mutalyombeka amaju, mutalisiga embibo, mutalibyara emisiri y'emizabbibbu rundi kutunga ebintu; baitu obwomeezi bwanyu bwona, murralege omu heema, nukwo muhangaale omunsi ei musuuhuukiremu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiragiro isenkuru itwe Yonadabbu mutabani wa Rrekabbu ebi yaturagiire, tukabikwatira kimu, itwe nabakazi baitu, n'abatabani baitu, na bahara baitu, titunywa eviini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "titwombeka maju ag'okuraaramu; titugira musiri ogw'emizabbibbu, kandi titubyara musiri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "turaara omu heema, byona isenkuru itwe Yonadabbu ebi yaturagiire, tukabihikiririza kimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Nebbukadaneeza omukama wa Bbabbulooni obu yaseesiire ensi enu twacwamu tuti, ‘Turuge hanu tugende! Tugende Yerusaalemu, nukwo tutabuke ihe ery'Abakalidaaya n'ery'Abasiriya,’ nikyo turaikarra Yelusalemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikamanyisibwa Yeremiya kiti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Genda ogambire abantu ba Yuda n'abasi ba Yerusaalemu oti, MUKAMA w'amahe Ruhanga owa Isirairi naagamba ati, ‘Timwaikirize ebi murukwegesibwa, kandi timwakwate ebigambo byange?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiragiro eky'okutanywa viini Yonadabbu mutabani wa Rrekabbu eki yateeriireho batabani be, eby'okutanywa viini, bakakikwata; okuhika na hati, tibaginywa naakake, habwokuba bakakwata ekiragiro kya isenkurubo. Nyowe nkaikara nimbagambira, baitu mutampurre. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabatumaho abaheereza bange boona abarangi, nkabatuma obutalekerra, ningamba nti, ‘Buli omu omuli inywe, ayeteere engeso ze embi, ayegarukemu, muleke kukuraatira embandwa n'okuziheereza nubwo muliikara omunsi ei nabahaire, kandi ei nahaire baisenkuru inywe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batabani ba Yonadabbu mutabani wa Rrehabbu, bakakwata ekiragiro, isenkurubo eki yabahaire, baitu abantu banu, nyowe bakanga kumpurra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki MUKAMA Ruhanga ow'amahe, Ruhanga owa Isirairi nikyo arukugambira ati: Abantu ba Yuda n'abasi ba Yerusaalemu boona, ninyija kubaleetera akabi koona aka nabagambireho; habwokuba nkabagambira tibaahurra, nkabeeta tibaagarukamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu eb'ekika ky'Abarrekabbu, Yeremiya akabagambira ati: MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga owa Isirairi naagamba ati: Habwokuba mukakwata ekiragiro kya Yonadabu isenkuru inywe mwahikiriza byona ebi yaragiire kandi mwakora byona ebi yabaragiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA ow'amahe Ruhanga owa Isirairi nikyo arukugambira ati: Ebiro byona, Yonadabbu mutabani wa Rrekabbu taliburwa omuntu ow'okwemerra omumaiso gange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
